==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|osp|cridar|cridar, gridar|}}, from {{inh|es|ML.|crīdō||to cry out, publish, proclaim}}, from {{der|es|frk|*krītan|t=to cry out, scream, proclaim}} (--Littré), related to {{cog|dum|crītan|t=to cry}}.

An alternative (less likely) origin is {{inh|es|la|quirītō||to shriek, hiss}}.

Cognate with {{cog|ca|cridar}}, {{cog|fr|crier}}, {{cog|it|gridare}}, and {{cog|pt|gritar}}. Compare {{cog|en|cry}}.

